| F5OS Provider |     Terraform Plugin Protocol      | Terraform | F5OS Velos/rSeries Version |
|:-------------:|:----------------------------------:|:---------:|:--------------------------:|
|`1.0.0-1.10.2` |                `6`                 | `>= 1.x`  |      `>= 1.5.x/1.4.0`      |
